CÂU HỎI TRUY TÌM MỐI ĐE DỌA (THREAT HUNTING QUERY):
"Bốn quan sát Security 4688 và Sysmon 1 trong core cmd.exe → mshta.exe → powershell.exe tương ứng bao nhiêu process creations? Giải thích parent/child correlation và vì sao conhost.exe ở ngoài core."

=== CONTEXT PHÁP Y & TRI THỨC AN TOÀN THÔNG TIN ===

[CÁC ĐOẠN TRI THỨC TRUY XUẤT (RETRIEVAL CHUNKS: 5)]
- Chunk retrieval-chunk--86dd89fe0cfd03c1505a8534ce63dfb9f72221fe32c23d7a0341a66fa98d48ad [scenario_summary] (Source: /scenario):
  Source text (preserve any negation/unverified qualifiers):
  Scenario 3.3.2 Kịch bản thực thi PowerShell nghi vấn. Description: Reviewable MSHTA-PowerShell scenario in which cmd.exe launches mshta.exe and mshta.exe launches powershell.exe with -noexit -command Get-Service sysmon. Process creation records establish the launch command, not successful cmdlet completion or a finalized attack determination. Analysis status: draft_reviewable. Observed behavior: PowerShell was launched with -noexit -command Get-Service sysmon. cmd.exe launched mshta.exe with an inline vbscript:Execute command. mshta.exe launched PowerShell.
